  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-early-next-week:seg:0",
      "text": "Last item. The new annual plan goes live on the 16th, and sales keeps getting the same five questions."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-early-next-week:seg:1",
      "text": "Proration, seat changes mid-year, refunds, currency, and whether the discount stacks with the nonprofit one."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-early-next-week:seg:2",
      "text": "We need a pricing FAQ on the site before the launch email goes out."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-early-next-week:seg:3",
      "text": "When does the launch email go?"
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-early-next-week:seg:4",
      "text": "The plan is the morning of the 16th, but marketing wants the FAQ link in the draft before then."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-early-next-week:seg:5",
      "text": "I can write the FAQ. Most of the answers are already in the sales notes."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-early-next-week:seg:6",
      "text": "Great. Let's aim for early next week for the FAQ, then."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-early-next-week:seg:7",
      "text": "Early next week, sure."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-early-next-week:seg:8",
      "text": "Run the refund answer past finance before it goes up."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-early-next-week:seg:9",
      "text": "Yes, I'll send that one to Gareth first."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-early-next-week:seg:10",
      "text": "And the nonprofit stacking question, the answer is no, they don't stack."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-early-next-week:seg:11",
      "text": "Then we should say that plainly. People will try."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-early-next-week:seg:12",
      "text": "Got it. Plain no, with a line on which discount wins."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-deadline-early-next-week:seg:13",
      "text": "Perfect. Thanks, all."
    }
  ],
